            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              We use professional non-destructive entry techniques to unlock your vehicle without damaging your door, window, or lock mechanisms. We work on all vehicle makes and models — sedans, trucks, SUVs, minivans, and commercial vehicles. Call us instead of attempting DIY entry, which can cause expensive damage.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4">
              <a href={`/services/automotive-locksmith/${slug}/car-lockout/`} class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold hover:underline text-sm">Learn more about Car Lockout Service in Delaware →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Car Key Replacement -->
