          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 7a2 2 0 012 2m4 0a6 6 0 01-7.743 5.743L11 17H9v2H7v2H4a1 1 0 01-1-1v-2.586a1 1 0 01.293-.707l5.964-5.964A6 6 0 1121 9z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Car Key Replacement in {city}, {state}</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Lost your car keys in {city}? Don't pay dealership prices for a replacement. 1st Capital Locksmith cuts and programs replacement car keys on-site at your {city} location — for a fraction of what dealers charge, with no appointment and no tow required.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              We replace all types of car keys including standard cut keys, transponder chip keys, laser cut keys, and high-security keys for virtually all makes and models — Toyota, Honda, Ford, Chevrolet, Dodge, Nissan, Hyundai, Kia, BMW, Mercedes-Benz, Jeep, RAM, and more.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4">
              <a href={`/services/automotive-locksmith/${slug}/car-key-replacement/`} class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold hover:underline text-sm">Learn more about Car Key Replacement in Delaware →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Transponder Key -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 3H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v4m6-6h10a2 2 0 012 2v4M9 3v18m0 0h10a2 2 0 002-2V9M9 21H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9m0 0h18" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Transponder Key Programming in {city}, {state}</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Most vehicles made after 1995 use transponder keys — keys with an embedded chip that must be programmed to your specific vehicle. A copy cut at a hardware store won't start your car. 1st Capital Locksmith carries professional-grade transponder programming equipment and comes directly to your {city} location to cut and program your key on the spot.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              We deliver the same service as dealerships at a much lower cost, right to your location in {city} — without the wait or the tow truck. Call us for a quote on transponder key programming for your specific vehicle.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4">
              <a href={`/services/automotive-locksmith/${slug}/car-key-replacement/`} class="text-[#A61E22] font-semibold hover:underline text-sm">Learn more about Transponder Key Programming in Delaware →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Key Fob -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-6">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z" />
