            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              When your key fob stops working, gets lost, or needs to be replaced in {city}, 1st Capital Locksmith programs replacement fobs for all major vehicle brands on-site. We handle push-to-start proximity keys, remote start fobs, and standard key fobs — all programmed to your vehicle the same day.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
              Skip the dealership markup. Our mobile locksmith comes to your location in {city}, {state} and programs your replacement fob at a significantly lower cost with no appointment needed.
