            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-3">Ignition Repair & Replacement in {city}, {state}</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
              A faulty ignition cylinder can leave you stranded in {city} with a key that won't turn or won't come out. Don't force it — forcing a worn ignition can snap the key off inside, turning a fixable problem into a much more expensive repair. Call 1st Capital Locksmith at the first sign of ignition trouble in {city}.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
